              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Hardik requested a deck with case studies, particularly any work related to home improvement or similar industries, to better understand the team's capabilities.",
