        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Building Online Presence for Home Improvement Businesses",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "building_online_presence_for_home_improvement_businesses",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Bharat Platform aims to enhance online presence for small businesses in home improvement sector, with focus on pre-paint and post-paint categories. This involves creating online visibility, building trust through digital platforms for businesses like those specializing in surfaces, lighting, furnishings, and decor.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "111b8dcd-a82f-456e-b210-b683f20bdd4c",
                    "time": 142.12001,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Many small businesses lack strong online presence, affecting trust, market reach. Businesses, typically generating 20-30 crore annually, need to establish credibility, communicate legitimacy, especially if they operate as franchisees or distributors.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "676ec25c-b3b0-43cd-99f2-ca835f99e35a",
                    "time": 501.94998,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Initial focus will be on brand building and trust rather than immediate e-commerce development. Possible future e-commerce capabilities are considered as online market evolves.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "3d8ef4dd-f91b-411d-bbeb-05617b6e10f4",
                    "time": 607.77997,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Utilize platforms like Shopify, Wix, or WooCommerce for creating online storefronts, enhancing brand visibility. This includes optimizing searchability and showcasing product catalogs effectively.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "52ff8717-7de6-4e3f-ab40-2fc90d28b8ae",
                    "time": 607.77997,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
