            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Hardik's Project Requirements and Collaboration",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "hardik's_project_requirements_and_collaboration",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Difficulty for small businesses to create trust and credibility, reach wider audiences without a strong online presence. These businesses may serve as key players in specific regions or niches but need to expand their digital footprint.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "e756aed4-7ae2-4f55-9c09-7af5e0bb5385",
                    "time": 501.94998,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Explore AI-based solutions for marketing, branding support, helping businesses establish legitimacy online. This includes creating content like customer testimonials, interactive catalogs, and maintaining a strong social media presence.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "ae52aab7-fe25-407a-a2f5-29658ad69a01",
                    "time": 693.23,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Thinkbyte.ai to provide tailored strategies for enhancing brand visibility, leveraging their experience in AI-driven marketing to meet specific needs of businesses in this sector.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "40e1243d-9dc0-4ba3-aa88-1a7c539bab93",
                    "time": 693.23,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Hardik from Bharat Platform seeks collaboration with Thinkbyte.ai to support small businesses in the home improvement sector by building online presence and trust. The goal is to create a digital footprint that helps businesses convey trust and reach wider audiences.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
